因为 Ghassen 和 Satish 目前主要负责 MCP Development & API Integration，我建议按照每批 APIs 的集成任务来创建 Jira tickets，而不是简单地按照人员创建两个大任务。这样更方便 Scrum Master 跟踪 Sprint 的进展。

Task 1 – MCP Server Development

Summary: MyIAM – MCP Server Development

Description:

* Set up the MCP server for MyIAM API integration.
* Implement the common mechanisms for API invocation and response handling.
* Implement error handling.
* Align the MCP implementation with the Agent architecture.

Task 2 – MCP Integration – Request Tracking APIs

Summary: MyIAM – MCP Integration of Request Tracking APIs (Batch 1)

Description:

* Implement MCP tools for the following endpoints:
    * searchRequestsByUser
    * searchRequestsByAppEnt
    * searchRequestByStatus
    * getRequestDetails
* Ensure compliance with the defined security controls.
* Perform technical integration tests.

Task 3 – MCP Integration – Identity APIs

Summary: MyIAM – MCP Integration of Identity APIs (Batch 2)

Description:

* Implement MCP tools for the following endpoints:
    * searchIdentity
    * getIdentityDetails
    * getTeamDetails
* Ensure compliance with the defined security controls.
* Perform technical integration tests.

Task 4 – Authentication & User Identity Propagation

Summary: MyIAM – Authentication and Authenticated User Identity Propagation

Description:

* Clarify the authentication mechanism based on the Twin JWT.
* Define how the authenticated user’s identity is retrieved and propagated to the MyIAM APIs.
* Align the implementation with MyIAM authentication and authorization requirements.
* Validate the end-to-end authentication flow.

我建议目前先创建这四个 tickets。 第三批 APIs 可以等交付范围确认后再创建对应的 ticket。

至于 Ghassen 和 Satish 分别负责哪些任务，以及 Authentication 由 Twin、Innovation Lab 还是 MCP Developers 负责，目前还没有完全明确，所以建议先和他们确认分工，再设置 Assignee。

作为 PM，你需要定义的是 Scope、Expected Outcome 和 Acceptance Criteria，具体的技术实现细节可以让两位 Developers 自己补充。这样既能保证项目的可追踪性，也不会陷入 micromanagement。